    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"暴雨\"]  ......你想跟我们走......？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "暴雨",
        "content": "......你想跟我们走......？"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"暴雨\"]  你应该明白，对我们而言，你只是个可疑分子。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "暴雨",
        "content": "你应该明白，对我们而言，你只是个可疑分子。"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"“沙卒”\"]  检查过你的队伍了吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "“沙卒”",
        "content": "检查过你的队伍了吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\", name2=\"char_379_sesa_1#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png",
        "name2": "char_379_sesa_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"慑砂\"]  暴雨？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "慑砂",
        "content": "暴雨？"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"暴雨\"]  ......一切正常。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "暴雨",
        "content": "......一切正常。"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"暴雨\"]  但我不信任你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "暴雨",
        "content": "但我不信任你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"“沙卒”\"]  嗯嗯，说得好，我当然不值得信任。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "“沙卒”",
        "content": "嗯嗯，说得好，我当然不值得信任。"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"暴雨\"]  你的目的是什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "暴雨",
        "content": "你的目的是什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"“沙卒”\"]  我的目的是......找到我的目的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "“沙卒”",
        "content": "我的目的是......找到我的目的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain#4\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain#4.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"暴雨\"]  你在说什么——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "暴雨",
        "content": "你在说什么——"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_304_hvrain#4\", name2=\"avg_npc_172_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_304_hvrain#4.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"“沙卒”\"]  你们知道吗？伊巴特地区的王酋——曾惨死在火灾之中。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "“沙卒”",
        "content": "你们知道吗？伊巴特地区的王酋——曾惨死在火灾之中。"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_172_1\", name2=\"char_379_sesa_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_172_1.png",
        "name2": "char_379_sesa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"慑砂\"]  ......那是两三年前的事了。现任王酋是他的儿子，在伊巴特地区引发了不小的骚动......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "慑砂",
        "content": "......那是两三年前的事了。现任王酋是他的儿子，在伊巴特地区引发了不小的骚动......"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"慑砂\"]  多亏了那场火，我还不得不重新找个老东家，多花几个月时间适应新工作，烦人得很。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "慑砂",
        "content": "多亏了那场火，我还不得不重新找个老东家，多花几个月时间适应新工作，烦人得很。"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_172_1#3\", name2=\"char_379_sesa_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_172_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_379_sesa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"“沙卒”\"]  是啊，是啊，可那是我的最后一个猎物。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "“沙卒”",
        "content": "是啊，是啊，可那是我的最后一个猎物。"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"“沙卒”\"]  织好了网，铺好了陷阱，却没有猎物，我现在，很无所事事啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "“沙卒”",
        "content": "织好了网，铺好了陷阱，却没有猎物，我现在，很无所事事啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_172_1#3\", name2=\"char_379_sesa_1#3\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
